{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "09c3b648-2e37-8d32-b464-7ceebb3c2d60",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T11:11:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivone Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. This is Ivone Rocha. I am calling about my water and sewer bill? It looks wrong to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:07:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Rocha, what's looking off on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They put a new meter last month. And now the bill is much higher than before. Almost double. I do not think this is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. So the new meter went in last month, and this is the first bill since then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:07:53-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the first one. Same people in the house, same use. Nothing changed. [pause] I am careful shopper, I check the unit price on everything. So I look at this bill very closely. The number of units is too big."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:08:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. A lot of folks do the same thing. Do you know if the bill is an actual reading or an estimate? It'll say something like \"actual\" or \"est\" next to the reading."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:08:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, let me see. [pause] It says E. Then the number. Is E the estimate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:08:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, E is usually estimate. So nobody may have gotten a real read off the new meter yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense, because the meter is in the crawlspace under the house. Nobody goes in there. Nobody came in. I did not let anybody, and I did not see anybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:08:43-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that explains it. If they can't get to it, the system guesses, and a new meter with no history can guess high. What we'd want is an actual reading. Does the new meter have a remote reader on the outside of the house, or just the one in the crawlspace?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:09:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think only inside. I do not see anything outside. [line breaks up] Sorry, you are there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:09:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here, you're on speaker so it cuts a little. I can put in a request for a meter reader to schedule a visit, or you could read the dial yourself and call it in. Whichever is easier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:09:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not go in there, it is too small and dark. The visit is better. Can they call me before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:09:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll note that. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0155."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:09:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0155. I'll put the request in and ask that they call ahead. Once there's an actual reading, the bill gets adjusted if the estimate was too high."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:09:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. And one more question? Because I work in the day, and I cannot always call before 4:30. Is there a way to pay by phone after 4:30? Or online?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:09:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's online payment on the city website, that's open all hours. There's also an automated phone payment line that works after we close, and a drop box at City Hall for checks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:10:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The automatic phone, is it also on the bill? The number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:10:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It should be printed on the bill, usually near the payment stub. If you can't find it, call back and I'll give it to you during the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:10:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. But I do not want to pay the high amount if it is wrong, you know? So I wait?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:10:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. I'd wait until the reading is done and the bill is corrected, but keep an eye on the due date. If it gets close, call us and we'll note the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:10:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I understand. It is annoying, because the meter is new, it should be better, not worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:10:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Hopefully the real reading sorts it out. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:10:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Mr. Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:11:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Rocha. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
